{"hits": {"hits": [{"links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/583553?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A583553"}, "id": "583553", "updated": "2023-03-07T00:20:24.253495+00:00", "metadata": {"publication_info": [{"journal_volume": "03", "artid": "017", "year": 2002, "journal_record": {"$ref": "https://inspirehep.net/api/journals/1213103"}, "page_start": "017", "journal_title": "JHEP"}], "authors": [{"full_name": "Dasgupta, Mrinal"}, {"full_name": "Salam, Gavin P."}], "texkeys": ["Dasgupta:2002bw"], "abstracts": [{"value": "Recently, interest has developed in the distribution of interjet energy flows, with for example the leading-log calculation of the highly non-trivial colour structure of primary emissions in 4-jet systems. Here we point out however that at leading-log level it is insufficient to consider only multiple primary emission from the underlying hard antenna -- additionally, one must take into account the coherent structure of emission from arbitrarily complicated ensembles of large-angle soft gluons. Similar considerations apply to certain definitions of rapidity gaps based on energy flow. We examine this new class of terms in the simpler context of 2-jet events, and discover features that point at novel aspects of the QCD dynamics."}], "control_number": 583553, "dois": [{"value": "10.1088/1126-6708/2002/03/017"}], "arxiv_eprints": [{"value": "hep-ph/0203009"}], "titles": [{"title": "Accounting for coherence in interjet E(t) flow: A Case study"}, {"title": "Accounting for coherence in interjet E(t) flow: A case study."}], "author_count": 2, "document_type": ["article"]}, "created": "2002-03-04T00:00:00+00:00"}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&fields=control_number,titles.title,authors.full_name,author_count,publication_info,arxiv_eprints.value,dois.value,texkeys,abstracts.value,document_type,imprints,isbns,collaborations.value", "bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&fields=control_number,titles.title,authors.full_name,author_count,publication_info,arxiv_eprints.value,dois.value,texkeys,abstracts.value,document_type,imprints,isbns,collaborations.value&format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=eprint%20hep-ph%2F0203009&size=3&page=1&format=cv"}}